          %p
            The
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi d
                    %mo =
                    %mn 4
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} d = 4
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi N
                  %mo =
                  %mn 2
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N =2
            super Minkowski spacetime was originally introduced in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Abdus+Salam"} Abdus Salam
                J.A. Strathdee,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supergauge Transformations
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/89208"} spire
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Abdus+Salam"} Abdus Salam
                J.A. Strathdee, Physical Review D11, 1521-1535 (1975)
          %p
            see at “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superspace"} superspace
            in physics”.
          %p Further discussion includes:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %em Super spacetimes and super Poincaré-group
                (
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.ucla.edu/~vsv/papers/ch6.pdf"}> pdf
                )
            %li#Freed01
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Freed"}> Daniel Freed
                , lecture 6 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Classical field theory and Supersymmetry
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.ma.utexas.edu/users/dafr/pcmi.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Freed"}> Daniel Freed
                ,
                %em
                  Lecture 4 of
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Five+lectures+on+supersymmetry"} Five lectures on supersymmetry
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Veeravalli+Varadarajan"}> Veeravalli Varadarajan
                , section 7 of
                %em Supersymmetry for mathematicians: An introduction
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leonardo+Castellani"}> Leonardo Castellani
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"} Riccardo D'Auria
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fre"}> Pietro Fre
                  , page 370, part II section II.3.3 of
                = succeed "_" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Supergravity+and+Superstrings+-+A+Geometric+Perspective"} Supergravity and Superstrings - A Geometric Perspective
          %p
